# Editor / TipTap

Follow **`.cursor/skills/editor-tiptap/SKILL.md`** for the full mental model and patterns.

## Must preserve

- **One TipTap document per page** (`PageDocumentEditor`) so selection can span blocks; app-level `Block[]` still serialize via `lib/pageDocument/`.
- **Vite `@tiptap/pm/*` aliases** in `vite.config.ts` — add aliases for new PM subpaths; do not remove the map.
- **Wiki link `href`** and other app URLs use **`import.meta.env.BASE_URL`**.
- External workspace reload: `setContent(..., { emitUpdate: false })` when replacing from outside.

## Tests

Prefer extending colocated editor / `pageDocument` tests; see **`frontend-testing`** rule.
